 (gr_text "#1: Info: below are the conversion remarks. The conversion may contain errors.\nPlease read the remarks carefully and run the DRC check to solve issues.\nTo find a component mentioned in the remarks go to:\nKicad menu Edit > Find and enter the EDA_id (gge....); search for other text items.\nOnly the id of the footprint can be found; the id of the shape is in the input json.\nYou can export the footprints to a library by Kicad menu File > Export > Export Fps to (new) Library" (at -200 16.2 0) (layer "Cmts.User") (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4)) (justify left))) 
 (gr_text "#2: Info : SVGNODE on layer B.SilkS has been converted into 31 polylines.\nSvg cutouts are not supported and result in overlapping filled polylines.\nNot OK? -> You can change the fill of some polylines to change the image." (at -200 36 0) (layer "Cmts.User") (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4)) (justify left))) 
 (gr_text "#3: Info: total of 2 Cu zones were created. Run DRC to check for overlap of zones.\nAdjust zone priority to solve this. Adjust other parameters as needed.\nNote: merge zones if possible (right click selected 2 zones > Zones > Merge zones)." (at -200 46.8 0) (layer "Cmts.User") (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4)) (justify left))))